@host = http://localhost:5000/api
@root = http://localhost:5000

### Liveness: is the process up (anonymous, outside /api)
GET {{root}}/health/live

### Readiness: is the database reachable too (anonymous, outside /api)
GET {{root}}/health/ready

### Login as the bootstrapped root manager (RootManager section of appsettings.Development.json)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "root@wmh.local", "password": "dev-root-password" }

### Current user
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}
GET {{host}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Manager: list courses
GET {{host}}/courses?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Manager: list agents
GET {{host}}/users?role=agent&status=active&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Login as the seeded agent
# @name agentLogin
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "agent@wmh.local", "password": "dev-agent-password" }

### Agent: learning dashboard
@agentToken = {{agentLogin.response.body.token}}
@agentId = {{agentLogin.response.body.user.id}}
GET {{host}}/learn/courses?agent_id={{agentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}

### Agent: course tree
GET {{host}}/learn/courses/101?agent_id={{agentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}

### Agent: quiz lock status
GET {{host}}/learn/quiz/lock?agent_id={{agentId}}&item_id=22
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}

### Rejected: acting as a different agent (expects 403)
GET {{host}}/learn/courses?agent_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}

### Dev only: wipe back to the root account
POST {{host}}/dev/reset
